    "detailed_description": "<strong>The Idle</strong> is the absolute version of all idle clicker games brought together. Infinite possibilities, infinite gameplay, infinite fun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLICKS OR GENERATORS</h2> Choose the way you prefer more to generate income. Or use both of them simultaneously. No limits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURRENCIES AND POSSIBILITIES</h2>Earn seven different currencies that can be exchanged between each other. Each currency can be used to buy specific upgrades.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTEREST AND RISKY INCOME</h2>Invest your funds into stable interest profit or take the risk and use a bets system to get a jackpot instantly!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ULTIMATE PRESTIGE</h2>You can buy prestige upgrades almost for everything. Don't limit yourself choosing between two or more options. Just buy them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERKS AND SUPER UPGRADES</h2>Enormous amount of perks is available to boost your income. Buy special super upgrades that change the whole game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS AND CHALLENGES</h2>Try to collect all one hundred achievements and sooner or later complete the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SETUP YOUR OWN LOOK</h2>Choose between dark and light theme, change in-game fonts and many more!<br><br><strong>The Idle</strong> offers endless possibilities and fun. Try it now and see for yourself!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The Idle</strong> is the absolute version of all idle clicker games brought together. Infinite possibilities, infinite gameplay, infinite fun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLICKS OR GENERATORS</h2> Choose the way you prefer more to generate income. Or use both of them simultaneously. No limits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURRENCIES AND POSSIBILITIES</h2>Earn seven different currencies that can be exchanged between each other. Each currency can be used to buy specific upgrades.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTEREST AND RISKY INCOME</h2>Invest your funds into stable interest profit or take the risk and use a bets system to get a jackpot instantly!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ULTIMATE PRESTIGE</h2>You can buy prestige upgrades almost for everything. Don't limit yourself choosing between two or more options. Just buy them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERKS AND SUPER UPGRADES</h2>Enormous amount of perks is available to boost your income. Buy special super upgrades that change the whole game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS AND CHALLENGES</h2>Try to collect all one hundred achievements and sooner or later complete the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SETUP YOUR OWN LOOK</h2>Choose between dark and light theme, change in-game fonts and many more!<br><br><strong>The Idle</strong> offers endless possibilities and fun. Try it now and see for yourself!",
